#, rust-format
msgid "Spotifast {version} • not affiliated with Spotify"
msgstr "Spotifast {version} • niet verbonden aan Spotify"

#: src/ui/login.rs:170
msgid ""
"That doesn't look like a Client ID. It is 32 letters and digits, shown on "
"Spotify's page for your registration."
msgstr ""
"Dat lijkt geen Client ID. Die bestaat uit 32 letters en cijfers en staat op "
"de pagina van Spotify voor je registratie."

#: src/ui/login.rs:174
msgid ""
"Spotify doesn't know this Client ID. Copy it again from Spotify's developer "
"dashboard."
msgstr ""
"Spotify kent deze Client ID niet. Kopieer hem opnieuw uit het "
"ontwikkelaarsdashboard van Spotify."

#: src/ui/login.rs:178
msgid ""
"Spotify didn't let this account use this Client ID. Sign in with the Spotify "
"account that registered it, which needs Premium."
msgstr ""
"Spotify liet dit account deze Client ID niet gebruiken. Log in met het "
"Spotify-account dat hem heeft geregistreerd. Dat account heeft Premium nodig."

#: src/ui/login.rs:182
msgid ""
"Spotify no longer accepts the shared sign-in Spotifast used before. Register "
"Spotifast to keep listening."
msgstr ""
"Spotify accepteert de gedeelde aanmelding die Spotifast eerder gebruikte "
"niet meer. Registreer Spotifast om te blijven luisteren."

#: src/ui/login.rs:219
msgid "A native Spotify client."
msgstr "Een native Spotify-client."

#: src/ui/login.rs:233
msgid "Waiting for Spotify in your browser…"
msgstr "Wachten op Spotify in je browser…"

#: src/ui/login.rs:241
msgid "Didn't open? Open the sign-in page again"
msgstr "Niet geopend? Open de inlogpagina opnieuw"

#: src/ui/login.rs:257
#, rust-format
msgid ""
"If Spotify says “Invalid redirect URI”, add {uri} to your registration "
"exactly, save, and sign in again."
msgstr ""
"Zegt Spotify “Invalid redirect URI”, voeg dan {uri} precies zo toe aan je "
"registratie, sla op en log opnieuw in."

#: src/ui/login.rs:310
msgid "Sign in with Spotify"
msgstr "Inloggen met Spotify"

#: src/ui/login.rs:321
msgid ""
"Sign in through your browser. Spotifast never sees your password. Local "
"playback needs Spotify Premium."
msgstr ""
"Log in via je browser. Spotifast ziet je wachtwoord nooit. Lokaal afspelen "
"vereist Spotify Premium."

#: src/ui/login.rs:330
msgid "How to register Spotifast"
msgstr "Zo registreer je Spotifast"

#: src/ui/login.rs:354
msgid "Proxy Settings"
msgstr "Proxyinstellingen"

#: src/ui/login.rs:404
msgid ""
"A Client ID is 32 letters and digits. Copy it from Spotify's developer "
"dashboard."
msgstr ""
"Een Client ID bestaat uit 32 letters en cijfers. Kopieer hem uit het "
"ontwikkelaarsdashboard van Spotify."

#: src/ui/login.rs:464
msgid ""
"Spotify asks you to register Spotifast once, on an account with Premium. It "
"takes about two minutes and gives you a Client ID."
msgstr ""
"Spotify vraagt je Spotifast eenmalig te registreren, op een account met "
"Premium. Het duurt ongeveer twee minuten en je krijgt er een Client ID voor "
"terug."

#: src/ui/login.rs:474
msgid "Open Spotify's developer dashboard."
msgstr "Open het ontwikkelaarsdashboard van Spotify."

#: src/ui/login.rs:495
msgid ""
"Click Create app, Spotify's name for this registration. Any name will do."
msgstr ""
"Klik op “Create app”, zo noemt Spotify deze registratie. Elke naam is goed."

#: src/ui/login.rs:503
msgid "Under Redirect URIs, add exactly:"
msgstr "Voeg onder “Redirect URIs” precies dit toe:"

#: src/ui/login.rs:512
msgid "Tick Web API, accept the terms, and save."
msgstr "Vink “Web API” aan, accepteer de voorwaarden en sla op."

#: src/ui/login.rs:519
msgid "Paste the Client ID into the field and sign in."
msgstr "Plak de Client ID in het veld en log in."

#: src/ui/mod.rs:409
msgid "Spotify is being slow on the shared sign-in."
msgstr "Spotify is traag met de gedeelde aanmelding."

#: src/ui/mod.rs:412
msgid ""
"Spotifast no longer offers the shared sign-in, and Spotify can stop "
"accepting it at any time. Register Spotifast and you won't have to wait."
msgstr ""
"Spotifast biedt de gedeelde aanmelding niet meer aan, en Spotify kan die op "
"elk moment weigeren. Registreer Spotifast, dan hoef je niet te wachten."

#. Translators: a button that opens a page explaining why
